    whyCorrectOverSecondBest: L('A is required while the right attacker controls the ball; B begins only when the second pass is released.', 'A vrijedi dok desni napadač kontrolira loptu; B počinje tek kada drugo dodavanje krene.', 'A gilt beim Ballbesitz rechts; B beginnt erst mit dem zweiten Pass.'),
